  "changes": [
    "Extract selected database schema/classes/functions with ast.unparse; omit function docstrings only.",
    "Explicitly allow savepoint nesting in native database helpers. Outer controller transaction owns commit; this change is safe only because all filesystem/hooks/config paths are disabled.",
    "Replace selected lazy import statements with unconditional RuntimeError, no user profile or project imports.",
    "Sealed replacement helpers: reasoning/profile overrides reject non-None; board metadata empty; board name isolated; explicit bounded TTL; hooks and workspace cleanup inert; artifact metadata rejected.",
    "File-length check uses SQLite page metadata and stat only; never opens database outside SQLite while live.",
    "Do not expose this capsule directly to model executors. Native lifecycle CAS and run records are wrapped by controller epochs, leases and grants."
  ],
